* According to the investigator's judgment, it may interfere with Test results or medical history, personal history and allergy history that increase the risk of patients;
* Those who have participated in clinical trials of other drugs within the last 3 months;
* Those who cannot be followed up regularly or who cannot cooperate with the investigator. The trial is associated with the ICD-10 code A393.

The sample represents a clinical trial in Phase1 for patients with Myelodysplastic Syndromes. The trial involves the drugs ibi188+azacitidine. The eligibility criteria for inclusion in the trial include Inclusion Criteria:

